WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.491 --> 00:00:02.378
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.842 --> 00:00:09.756
- Sangria this wine is to
die for what is the secret?

00:00:09.756 --> 00:00:12.342
- My handmaiden accidently dropped a bunch

00:00:12.342 --> 00:00:14.075
of chopped apples into the barrels.

00:00:14.075 --> 00:00:14.771
- Delicious.

00:00:14.771 --> 00:00:16.571
- I think it's absolute piss.

00:00:16.571 --> 00:00:17.918
- Well I have been meaning to tell you

00:00:17.918 --> 00:00:19.485
this morning I had a bit of fun

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:21.340
with my stepdaughter Jenifaria.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.394
- Oh I'd love to hear I've
been having a terrible time

00:00:23.394 --> 00:00:24.788
connecting with Britania.

00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:26.146
- Then you will love this.

00:00:26.146 --> 00:00:29.223
I woke up very early this
mornng, I snuck into her room

00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:31.765
and I shrunk all of her wardrobe

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:33.690
so that she thinks she's gaining weight

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:35.281
then I barricaded her in her room

00:00:35.281 --> 00:00:38.627
and filled it with mice and
now they're her only friends.

00:00:38.627 --> 00:00:39.438
- And that works?

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:42.458
- Oh yes she actually confides
in the mice quite a bit.

00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:44.141
- He hasn't called to me in a fortnight

00:00:44.141 --> 00:00:46.034
I mean do you think I should call to him

00:00:46.034 --> 00:00:47.392
or is that too forward.

00:00:47.392 --> 00:00:48.124
- Oh dear.

00:00:48.124 --> 00:00:50.353
- That reminds me I did
the most delightful thing

00:00:50.353 --> 00:00:52.907
with my stepdaughter
Serenity just yesterday.

00:00:52.907 --> 00:00:53.882
- Oh please do tell.

00:00:53.882 --> 00:00:55.740
- I took her on a trip to the forrest

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.363
we had a lovely picnic then I drugged her,

00:00:58.363 --> 00:00:59.815
dropped her in a remote location,

00:00:59.815 --> 00:01:01.626
put gobbs of honey on her

00:01:01.626 --> 00:01:03.727
and let her fend off the bears.

00:01:03.727 --> 00:01:05.039
- That is classic.

00:01:05.039 --> 00:01:06.864
What did you do to your stepdaughter?

00:01:06.864 --> 00:01:09.114
- I hope it was fantastically twisted.

00:01:09.114 --> 00:01:10.893
- Yes it was I.

00:01:10.893 --> 00:01:13.401
Good morning sweet angel
I brought you breakfast.

00:01:13.401 --> 00:01:14.062
- [Voiceover] Go away.

00:01:14.062 --> 00:01:16.765
- Good afternoon delicate
flower I brought you a puppy.

00:01:16.765 --> 00:01:17.671
- [Voiceover] Get out of my life.

00:01:17.671 --> 00:01:19.188
- Thought you'd enjoy a late night snack.

00:01:19.188 --> 00:01:20.860
- [Voiceover] Burn in hell demon woman.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:24.198
- Wicked, wicked things like poison

00:01:24.198 --> 00:01:28.065
and forced betrothals, all of it.

00:01:28.065 --> 00:01:28.564
- Well done.

00:01:28.564 --> 00:01:30.038
- You keep her in line.

00:01:30.038 --> 00:01:33.045
- Oh all finished, Britania's
going to love these

00:01:33.045 --> 00:01:34.276
and they're going to keep her little feet

00:01:34.276 --> 00:01:36.853
so nice and warm.

00:01:36.853 --> 00:01:40.752
And by that I mean horribly
freezing cold all the time.

00:01:40.752 --> 00:01:42.647
- Just as I suspected.

00:01:42.647 --> 00:01:44.795
- Don't worry I'll put a spell on them.

00:01:44.795 --> 00:01:45.410
- [Voiceover] Let's go Victoria.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:46.385
- Thank you for having us.

00:01:46.385 --> 00:01:49.230
- I'm horribly wicked I promise.

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.919
I guess the scarf is off
the table, it matches.

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:55.911
It's Heather grey.

00:01:58.288 --> 00:02:00.721
(upbeat music)

